// lapels, brass buttons, long star-flecked tails, a belt with a scroll case and a spyglass, tall
// boots, an orrery staff. A Black woman: deep brown skin (tone 6), tight coils under the hat, a
// broad nose with a low bridge, full lips, high cheekbones (22 §3.3: a face from the sliders).
// The kit is a copy of crates/mftr-sim/champions/quill.ron (a test checks they match); the
// hand-made model in this folder stays what the game shows until the owner prefers this one.
// Quill: Artillery mage.
